// Entra ID MFA Push Fatigue
// Detects repeated MFA challenges that the user did not complete (error 500121) for one account in a short window: the pattern of an attacker with a valid password spamming push prompts until the user approves one.
// techniques: T1621   severity: high   status: experimental
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1621
//   Sign in to a lab account with its password and deny the MFA prompt five times.
// source: rules/credential-access/entra-mfa-fatigue.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
SigninLogs
| where ((ResultType =~ @"500121"))
| summarize Hits=count() by bin(TimeGenerated, 10m), UserPrincipalName
| where Hits >= 5
